{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238220/extras/FeatureGraphicEnglish.png?t=1743970732\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hand of Hexes is a <strong>no-text deckbuilder</strong> and <strong>tower defense</strong> game where you control the enemies' paths by constructing deadly mazes \u2013 using towers with crazy attack patterns. Create a perfect deck of exotic towers and magical spells that boost your defenses or slay your enemies!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238220/extras/roguelike_english.png?t=1743970732\" /></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each run is <strong>unique</strong> with different decks, encounters, and levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is <strong>no text and no descriptions - </strong>find out what each tower and spell does through trial and error</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make your way across a variety of <strong>procedural maps</strong> - and do it again, but <strong>harder</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238220/extras/Tower_defense_english.png?t=1743970732\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Hand of Hexes towers have <strong>unique attack patterns</strong>: they might only shoot in one direction, circle projectiles or launch <strong>fierce bees</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Position your towers to guide the enemies through deadly mazes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buff your towers via <strong>spell cards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238220/extras/Wishlist.png?t=1743970732\" /></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com